      "estleg:versionText": "Veise vabapidamise korral peab lamamisala looma kohta olema vähemalt järgmine: <table class=\"data\" rules=\"all\"> <tbody><tr> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> Veise vanus (kuu) </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> Veise keskmine kaal looma kohta (kg) </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> Lamamisaseme pikkus (m) </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> Lamamisaseme laius (m) </td> </tr> <tr> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 2–6 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 175 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 1,70–1,90 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 0,80–0,90 </td> </tr> <tr> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 6–18 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 350 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 1,90–2,00 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 0,90–1,00 </td> </tr> <tr> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 18–22 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 500 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 2,00–2,10 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 1,00–1,20 </td> </tr> <tr> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> üle 22 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 700 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 2,10–2,40 </td> <td align=\"middle\" valign=\"top\"> 1,20–1,30 </td> </tr> </tbody></table> Veise vabapidamise korral peab lamamisala looma kohta olema vähemalt järgmine:",
